#N canvas 30 30 2300 1600 12;
#X text 20 20 u_store -- a keyed line store with one file behind it. A list replaces the line whose first atom matches \, or appends. write writes the file \; load reads it into a separate text and replays every line out outlet 1 \, so the live store is never wiped by a load. Policy \, timing and the state bus are u_state's., f 58;
#X text 920 20 creation arg 1: the FULL PATH of its file \, absolute. inlet 1: a LIST to store \, or write \, or load. outlet 1: each stored line \, one message per line \, replayed by load. outlet 2: a bang whenever a line changed \, which is what u_state's dirty flag hangs off., f 58;
#X text 1620 20 An abstraction because there are two of it \, auto and manual. C-13, f 58;
#X obj 20 320 inlet;
#X obj 20 380 route write load;
#X obj 20 460 t b;
#X obj 20 520 symbol \$1;
#X msg 20 570 write -c \$1;
#X obj 620 460 t b b;
#X obj 900 520 symbol \$1;
#X msg 900 570 read -c \$1;
#X obj 620 640 t b b;
#X msg 800 700 0;
